wm-darwin autopilot: the Touch Bar phase without Escape

The strip no longer has an Escape key (the machine has a real one), so the phase touches
the six volume keys only: twelve key events, F10's release last. The keys are looked up in
kern.sf_touchbar.keys as before, on whichever layer the strip shows.

Applies on top of wm-darwin 3944e53 (a Touch Bar phase) in sources/chonkstep-darwin, branch
wm-darwin; working tree only, not committed there. It replaces
wm-darwin-touchbar-phase.patch's last step; that file is what 3944e53 committed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
